cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software and its accompanying data, please cite this work using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Learning hidden noise structure for quantum storage: code and data"
authors:
  - family-names: "Dai"
    given-names: "Weining"
    affiliation: "Chengdu University of Information Technology, Chengdu, China; Stony Brook University, Stony Brook, NY, USA"
abstract: >-
  Research code and generated data accompanying Learning hidden noise structure
  for quantum storage. The materials support algebraic checks, a finite-instance
  randomized-consensus certificate, specified noisy deployment simulations and
  figure generation. Conditional deployment simulations and historical learner
  records are distinguished from full-workflow guarantees. No processor
  experiment is reported. The native-duration model underperforms raw storage. Independent human proof
  review is pending. No new reuse license or DOI is asserted.
keywords:
  - "quantum information"
  - "quantum memory"
  - "channel learning"
  - "quantum error correction"
  - "reproducible research"
repository-code: "https://github.com/weiningdai7-code/quantum-storage-learning"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
url: "https://github.com/weiningdai7-code/quantum-storage-learning/releases/tag/v0.2.0"
